{"chunk_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop_0001", "doc_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "source_file": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop.md", "text": "# GL Journal Import Support SOP\n\n## Purpose\n\nUse this SOP to diagnose Oracle EBS General Ledger Journal Import issues for the GL module and the Journal Import business process.", "metadata": {"erp_module": "GL", "doc_type": "TECHNICAL_DESIGN", "business_process": "Journal Import", "section": "GL Journal Import Support SOP", "rag_priority": "medium", "metadata_confidence": 0.6, "doc_level": {"metadata_ref": "metadata_sidecar.json#sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "tables_count": 1, "packages_count": 0, "procedures_count": 1, "functions_count": 0, "error_codes_count": 3, "error_context_lines_count": 3, "keywords_count": 0, "top_tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "top_error_codes": ["APP-00268", "FRM-41830", "ORA-00054"]}, "chunk_level": {"tables": [], "views": [], "packages": [], "procedures": [], "functions": [], "error_codes": [], "error_context_lines": [], "keywords": []}}}
{"chunk_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop_0002", "doc_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "source_file": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop.md", "text": "## Scope\n\nThis procedure applies to support analysis of interface rows staged in `GL_INTERFACE` before and after Journal Import processing.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Read-only database access for diagnostic SQL.\n- Oracle EBS responsibility with access to Journal Import requests.\n- Known `GROUP_ID`, ledger, source, and accounting period.", "metadata": {"erp_module": "GL", "doc_type": "TECHNICAL_DESIGN", "business_process": "Journal Import", "section": "Scope", "rag_priority": "high", "metadata_confidence": 0.6, "doc_level": {"metadata_ref": "metadata_sidecar.json#sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "tables_count": 1, "packages_count": 0, "procedures_count": 1, "functions_count": 0, "error_codes_count": 3, "error_context_lines_count": 3, "keywords_count": 0, "top_tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "top_error_codes": ["APP-00268", "FRM-41830", "ORA-00054"]}, "chunk_level": {"tables": [], "views": [], "packages": [], "procedures": ["APPLIES"], "functions": [], "error_codes": [], "error_context_lines": [], "keywords": []}}}
{"chunk_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop_0003", "doc_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "source_file": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop.md", "text": "## Procedure\n\n1. Confirm the concurrent request status for Journal Import.\n2. Identify the source and `GROUP_ID` used by the feeder system.\n3. Review rejected rows in `GL_INTERFACE`.\n4. Correct source data or interface rows according to approved support procedures.\n5. Rerun Journal Import after validation checks pass.\n\n## Diagnostic SQL\n\n```sql\nSELECT status, group_id, set_of_books_id, accounting_date\nFROM gl_interface\nWHERE group_id = :group_id;\n```\n\nExpected output: rows with error status require correction before rerun. The query is read-only and safe for support diagnostics.", "metadata": {"erp_module": "GL", "doc_type": "TECHNICAL_DESIGN", "business_process": "Journal Import", "section": "Procedure", "rag_priority": "high", "metadata_confidence": 0.8, "doc_level": {"metadata_ref": "metadata_sidecar.json#sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "tables_count": 1, "packages_count": 0, "procedures_count": 1, "functions_count": 0, "error_codes_count": 3, "error_context_lines_count": 3, "keywords_count": 0, "top_tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "top_error_codes": ["APP-00268", "FRM-41830", "ORA-00054"]}, "chunk_level": {"tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "views": [], "packages": [], "procedures": [], "functions": [], "error_codes": [], "error_context_lines": [], "keywords": ["GROUP_ID"]}}}
{"chunk_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop_0004", "doc_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "source_file": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop.md", "text": "## Validation\n\n- Confirm no rejected rows remain in `GL_INTERFACE` for the target `GROUP_ID`.\n- Confirm journals were created in `GL_JE_HEADERS` and `GL_JE_LINES`.\n- Confirm the Journal Import Execution Report completes without error.\n\n## Known Errors\n\n- ORA-00054: resource busy and acquire with NOWAIT specified.\n- FRM-41830: List of Values contains no entries.\n- APP-00268: Please specify a valid printer.", "metadata": {"erp_module": "GL", "doc_type": "TECHNICAL_DESIGN", "business_process": "Journal Import", "section": "Validation", "rag_priority": "high", "metadata_confidence": 0.8, "doc_level": {"metadata_ref": "metadata_sidecar.json#sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "tables_count": 1, "packages_count": 0, "procedures_count": 1, "functions_count": 0, "error_codes_count": 3, "error_context_lines_count": 3, "keywords_count": 0, "top_tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "top_error_codes": ["APP-00268", "FRM-41830", "ORA-00054"]}, "chunk_level": {"tables": [], "views": [], "packages": [], "procedures": [], "functions": [], "error_codes": ["APP-00268", "FRM-41830", "ORA-00054"], "error_context_lines": ["- APP-00268: Please specify a valid printer.", "- FRM-41830: List of Values contains no entries.", "- ORA-00054: resource busy and acquire with NOWAIT specified."], "keywords": []}}}
{"chunk_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop_0005", "doc_id": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "source_file": "sample_gl_journal_import_sop.md", "text": "## Rollback/Recovery\n\nIf incorrect journals are created, follow approved reversal or deletion procedures for unposted journals. Do not update Oracle base tables directly.\n\n## References\n\n- Oracle General Ledger User Guide.\n- Internal support runbook for Journal Import recovery.", "metadata": {"erp_module": "GL", "doc_type": "TECHNICAL_DESIGN", "business_process": "Journal Import", "section": "Rollback/Recovery", "rag_priority": "low", "metadata_confidence": 0.6, "doc_level": {"metadata_ref": "metadata_sidecar.json#sample_gl_journal_import_sop", "tables_count": 1, "packages_count": 0, "procedures_count": 1, "functions_count": 0, "error_codes_count": 3, "error_context_lines_count": 3, "keywords_count": 0, "top_tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "top_error_codes": ["APP-00268", "FRM-41830", "ORA-00054"]}, "chunk_level": {"tables": [], "views": [], "packages": [], "procedures": [], "functions": [], "error_codes": [], "error_context_lines": [], "keywords": []}}}
{"chunk_id": "sample_gl_diagnostic_sql_0001", "doc_id": "sample_gl_diagnostic_sql", "source_file": "sample_gl_diagnostic_sql.sql", "text": "-- Purpose: diagnose Oracle EBS GL Journal Import interface rows for a specific group.\n-- Bind variables: :group_id is the Journal Import group identifier.\n-- Expected output: interface rows with status and accounting context for support review.\n-- Safety: read-only SELECT statement; do not modify Oracle EBS base tables.\n\nSELECT status,\n       group_id,\n       set_of_books_id,\n       accounting_date,\n       user_je_source_name\nFROM gl_interface\nWHERE group_id = :group_id;", "metadata": {"erp_module": "GL", "doc_type": "SQL", "business_process": "Journal Import", "section": null, "rag_priority": "medium", "metadata_confidence": 0.6, "doc_level": {"metadata_ref": "metadata_sidecar.json#sample_gl_diagnostic_sql", "tables_count": 1, "packages_count": 0, "procedures_count": 0, "functions_count": 0, "error_codes_count": 0, "error_context_lines_count": 0, "keywords_count": 1, "top_tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "top_error_codes": []}, "chunk_level": {"tables": ["GL_INTERFACE"], "views": [], "packages": [], "procedures": [], "functions": [], "error_codes": [], "error_context_lines": [], "keywords": ["GROUP_ID"]}}}
{"chunk_id": "sample_custom_plsql_package_0001", "doc_id": "sample_custom_plsql_package", "source_file": "sample_custom_plsql_package.pks", "text": "CREATE OR REPLACE PACKAGE xxgl_journal_diag_pkg AS\n  PROCEDURE diagnose_group(p_group_id IN NUMBER);\n  FUNCTION get_interface_status(p_group_id IN NUMBER) RETURN VARCHAR2;\nEND xxgl_journal_diag_pkg;\n/", "metadata": {"erp_module": "GL", "doc_type": "PLSQL", "business_process": "Journal Import", "section": null, "rag_priority": "high", "metadata_confidence": 0.6, "doc_level": {"metadata_ref": "metadata_sidecar.json#sample_custom_plsql_package", "tables_count": 0, "packages_count": 1, "procedures_count": 1, "functions_count": 1, "error_codes_count": 0, "error_context_lines_count": 0, "keywords_count": 0, "top_tables": [], "top_error_codes": []}, "chunk_level": {"tables": [], "views": [], "packages": ["XXGL_JOURNAL_DIAG_PKG"], "procedures": ["DIAGNOSE_GROUP"], "functions": ["GET_INTERFACE_STATUS"], "error_codes": [], "error_context_lines": [], "keywords": []}}}
